Subject: [PATCH 0167/1695] clk: add determine rate ops

Determine rate ops is useful for doing a set_rate and a parent change
at the same time.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 24d6b0cf6426a3d95730b973d17512d1e1e7b664 clk: add determine rate ops]
Change-Id: I27c512df5ee49b31f993a8d6a19426fc8d7eaee9
Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
---
 core/drivers/clk/clk.c     | 154 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 core/include/drivers/clk.h |  22 ++++++
 2 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 53 deletions(-)

